# VCS e IDE
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.sonarqube
**/.scannerwork

# Build / testes / cobertura
**/bin
**/obj
**/artifacts
**/TestResults
**/coverage
**/coverage.*
**/*.trx
**/*.coverage
**/*.coveragexml

# SonarQube / analise
sonar-project*.properties
sonar-analyze.ps1
.sonarqube
.scannerwork

# Secrets / env (nunca copiar para imagem)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/secrets
**/secrets.*
**/*secret*

# AppSettings sensiveis — manter apenas base + Development (necessarios para build)
# Production/Staging/Local etc. nunca devem ir para contexto (podem conter secrets)
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.Staging.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.Secrets.json
**/appsettings.*.Production.json
**/appsettings.*.Staging.json

# Docs e artefatos de repo (nao necessarios na imagem)
**/*.md
**/*.http
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
